        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286386?u=bc4894b945491e0834d2306dade7fef748ddf698&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Added missing values for <code class=\"notranslate\">text-autospace</code></li>\n<li>Added firefox support for values</li>\n<li>Added MDN URL</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Tested in Firefox Nightly 144.0a1 (2025-08-25) parses but no effect</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40912\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/40912/hovercard\">Content PR</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27672\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27672/hovercard\">Previous BCD PR</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/data/pull/1005\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/data/pull/1005/hovercard\">Data PR</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40966\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/40966/hovercard\">Firefox Release Note PR</a></li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27726",
            "title": "Firefox Nightly supports CSS `text-autospace` behind flag",
            "date_modified": "2025-09-03T10:02:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-09-01T14:38:50.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "dletorey",
                "url": "https://github.com/dletorey"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Chrome 140 adds support for the <code class=\"notranslate\">__Http-</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">__Host-Http-</code> cookie prefixes: see <a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/5170139586363392\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5170139586363392</a>, and also see <a href=\"https://github.com/httpwg/http-extensions/blob/main/draft-ietf-httpbis-layered-cookies.md#the-__http--prefix\">https://github.com/httpwg/http-extensions/blob/main/draft-ietf-httpbis-layered-cookies.md#the-__http--prefix</a> for further info.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR adds a data point for the new prefixes.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Note that currently I've not added the <code class=\"notranslate\">spec_url</code>, as the spec is not valid according to the browser-specs repo. I've requested it to be added in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3371996044\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/browser-specs/issues/2121\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/browser-specs/issues/2121/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/browser-specs/issues/2121\">w3c/browser-specs#2121</a>.</p>\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27724",
            "title": "Add BCD for Http and HostHttp cookie prefixes",
            "date_modified": "2025-09-03T07:47:23.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-09-01T09:47:18.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "chrisdavidmills",
                "url": "https://github.com/chrisdavidmills"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43580235?u=cae42d5a371dd041072ce6d85a1808de05535be8&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">CSS WG have decided that <code class=\"notranslate\">&amp;</code> inside <code class=\"notranslate\">@scope</code> blocks should be treated like <code class=\"notranslate\">:where(:scope)</code>. This has specificity implications, see the updated docs: <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/@scope#specificity_in_scope\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/@scope#specificity_in_scope</a></p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong>Spec:</strong> <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/9740\">https://redirect.github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/9740</a> (WIP)</li>\n<li><strong>Bugzilla:</strong> <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1975531\" rel=\"nofollow\">1975531</a></li>\n<li><strong>WPT:</strong> <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/53831\">https://redirect.github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/53831</a> (WIP)</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <strong>Parent issue:</strong> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3249101586\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40481\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40481/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40481\">mdn/content#40481</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3337599065\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40809\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/40809/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40809\">mdn/content#40809</a></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3338015037\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40814\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/40814/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40814\">mdn/content#40814</a></li>\n</ul>",
